<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Additional Qualitative Results</h2>

<figure id="A4.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.06751v1/unstructured_sd3_medium_new.png" id="A4.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/322;" width="548" height="322" alt="Refer to caption">
